.TH "HTMLTEXTAREAELEMENT.SELECTIONEND" "3JS" "October 28, 2026" "JavaScript" "JavaScript Reference Manual"
.SH NAME
HTMLTextAreaElement.selectionEnd \- HTMLTextAreaElement: selectionEnd
property
.SH SYNOPSIS
The \f[B]\f[CB]selectionEnd\f[B]\f[R] property of the
\f[CR]HTMLTextAreaElement\f[R] interface specifies the end position of
the current text selection in a \f[CR]<textarea>\f[R] element.
.PP
For general information about this property, see
\f[CR]HTMLInputElement.selectionEnd\f[R].
.SH VALUE
A non\-negative number representing the zero\-based index immediately
after the last selected character, or the caret position if no text is
selected.
